# Frontend

- API client: `web/src/api.ts` — keep types aligned with backend serializers
- Pages: Overview, Transactions / Needs Review, Settings (System)
- Needs Review: checkbox multi-select + `ClassifyPanel` (not inline picklists)
- Income card: click → `IncomeTrendModal` (pay-period chart + MoM)
- Transaction rows: debit amount red, credit amount green via `.tx-row.debit|.credit`

## Design

- Stay within existing `styles.css` language
- Do not add purple/cream “AI dashboard” themes, metric card color rainbows, or decorative glow/pill clusters
- Rebuild before verifying in the served app: `cd web && npm run build`
